B.JB=new A.h0("Klinik Nuha","Klinik Nuha is a clinic-focused healthcare application connecting patients with clinics nationwide, designed to deliver an efficient and user-friendly treatment experience.\n\nKey Features:\n1. Simplified appointment booking\n2. Centralized booking history\n3. Membership and patient record management\n\nTechnical Structure:\n- Robust Clean Architecture\n- Precise Dependency Injection\n- Performance-optimized Bloc state management","https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.klinik.apps",null,null,"assets/klinik.png",null,B.OS,B.OX)
